# Canonical IRI: http://dbpedia.org/resource/OpenLink_Software
# Priority ladder: DBpedia (1st) → Wikidata → LinkedIn company #this → Homepage #this
# DBpedia dereference verified: HTTP 200 (2026-07-08)
# First referenced in: agent-rdf-memory/core.ttl (schema:author, schema:worksFor)

:openlinkSoftware a schema:Organization ;
    schema:name "OpenLink Software"@en ;
    schema:description "OpenLink Software, Inc. — creator of Virtuoso Universal Server, URIBurner, YouID, and the OPAL AI Layer. Provider of Linked Data, Semantic Web, and AI-agent infrastructure."@en ;
    schema:url "https://www.openlinksw.com/" ;
    owl:sameAs <http://dbpedia.org/resource/OpenLink_Software> ;
    rdfs:comment "Canonical entity IRI. DBpedia resource is the canonical form (verified via HTTP 200 dereference, 2026-07-08). First referenced in agent-rdf-memory/core.ttl as schema:author and schema:worksFor for Kingsley Uyi Idehen and agent identity. Also referenced in session files as prov:wasAttributedTo target."@en ;
    schema:dateCreated "2026-05-27T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

# ── AfterQuery ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Canonical IRI: https://linkedin.com/company/afterquery#this
# Priority ladder: DBpedia (none — resource/page 404) → Wikidata (search empty 2026-09-01) → LinkedIn company #this
# linkedin.com/company/afterquery HEAD 200 (2026-09-01)
# Homepage https://afterquery.com HEAD 200 → https://www.afterquery.com/

:afterQuery a schema:Organization ;
    schema:name "AfterQuery"@en ;
    schema:description "Y Combinator Winter 2025 company that sells expert-curated training data and reinforcement-learning environments to frontier labs; San Francisco applied research lab; Evaluate/Curate/Post-train/Deploy loop; ~100k verified professionals. Reported $3.2B valuation September 2026."@en ;
    schema:url "https://afterquery.com" ;
    schema:email "research@afterquery.com" ;
    owl:sameAs <https://linkedin.com/company/afterquery#this>,
               <https://www.linkedin.com/company/afterquery#this>,
               <https://www.afterquery.com/#this>,
               <https://afterquery.com#this> ;
    rdfs:comment "Canonical entity IRI is LinkedIn company #this (linkedin.com/company/afterquery HEAD 200, 2026-09-01). No DBpedia resource (http://dbpedia.org/resource/AfterQuery and page 404). Wikidata wbsearchentities AfterQuery returned zero hits. www.linkedin.com/company/afterquery 429 this pass — www alias still included. Homepage https://afterquery.com HEAD 200 redirects to https://www.afterquery.com/; both homepage#this forms aliased. YC company page https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/afterquery HEAD 200 is a document URL (not used as owl:sameAs). Buyer path research@afterquery.com is an org contact, not a person email. First registered 2026-09-01 from the AfterQuery Grok share and Forbes $3.2B story."@en ;
    schema:dateCreated "2026-09-01T21:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

