# ── Hugging Face ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Canonical IRI: http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hugging_Face
# Priority ladder: DBpedia (1st) -> Wikidata -> LinkedIn company #this -> Homepage #this
# DBpedia dereference verified: HTTP 200 (2026-09-03); DBpedia's own owl:sameAs
# names Wikidata Q108943604, independently cross-confirmed via Wikidata search.

:huggingFace a schema:Organization ;
    schema:name "Hugging Face"@en ;
    schema:legalName "Hugging Face, Inc."@en ;
    schema:description "American-French AI company (founded 2016, headquartered in New York City) that operates the Hugging Face Hub, an open platform for sharing and discovering machine-learning models, datasets, and Spaces (applications); creator of the open-source Transformers, Diffusers, and Datasets libraries. Serves 18M+ developers, researchers, and creators, and is used by companies worldwide to discover, evaluate, customize, and deploy AI. On 2026-09-03 NVIDIA agreed to acquire Hugging Face for approximately $12.93B; per NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang's announcement, Hugging Face is to remain an open, hardware-neutral platform, with NVIDIA compute not required to build on or deploy through it. Deal announced as AGREED, not yet closed."@en ;
    schema:url "https://huggingface.co" ;
    owl:sameAs <http://dbpedia.org/resource/Hugging_Face>,
               <http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q108943604>,
               <https://linkedin.com/company/huggingface#this>,
               <https://www.linkedin.com/company/huggingface#this>,
               <https://huggingface.co#this> ;
    rdfs:comment "Canonical entity IRI is DBpedia Hugging_Face (dbpedia.org/resource/Hugging_Face and dbpedia.org/data/Hugging_Face.json GET 200, 2026-09-03; DBpedia's own owl:sameAs cites Wikidata Q108943604, independently cross-confirmed via a separate Wikidata search hit 'Hugging Face (Q108943604), American company'). LinkedIn company page linkedin.com/company/huggingface HEAD 200 (2026-09-03); www.linkedin.com/company/huggingface HEAD 200 also. Homepage https://huggingface.co HEAD 200 (2026-09-03). Acquisition context: NVIDIA agreed to acquire Hugging Face for ~$12.93B per Jensen Huang's 2026-09-03 LinkedIn post (https://www.linkedin.com/posts/jenhsunhuang_im-excited-to-announce-that-nvidia-has-agreed-share-7501248004402667520-Z99s/, HTTP 200) and NVIDIA's own blog (blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-to-acquire-hugging-face/); corroborated same-day by CNBC and Yahoo Finance coverage. The deal is AGREED, not closed/completed, per Huang's own wording ('agreed to acquire') and press coverage (Trending Topics) noting the deal is not yet finalized and expected to face antitrust review — not overstated here. First registered 2026-09-03 from that announcement and its qualified-reactor context (Victor Mustar, Jeff Boudier — see entities/people.ttl). Local name :huggingFace is a registry index label only."@en ;
    schema:dateCreated "2026-09-03T16:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime .

